2026-06-28 02:58:36,559 | AGENT | SecurityCompliance Agent answered: Based on our company context, we have ISO 27001 certification since 2023, which covers development, delivery, and operations. This indicates our commitment to information security management. Additionally, our ISO 27701 certification provides a privacy information management extension, ensuring we handle personal data responsibly.

